  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde HR Phone Numbers:\n\n1. **540-362-4911** \u2014 This is listed as the primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n2. **1-800-380-4681** \u2014 This is the **HR Support Center** number, which can also be reached via email at **HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd50 Hours of Operation:\nWhen contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips:\n- To make the most of your call, have your information ready. If you are a current employee, be sure to provide your employee ID or other identifying information. If you are a job seeker, be prepared to mention the position you are applying for, the date you submitted your application, or any previous correspondence.",
